usage: classify_candidate.py [-h] --repo REPO --head HEAD --output OUTPUT

Read-only classification of a real final candidate, using frozen base policy.
This does not create commits, stage files, update refs, publish or grant
approval. The candidate must already exist locally and descend from the tested
implementation.

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --head HEAD
  --output OUTPUT
